  "body": "While implementing https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/pull/14431/ , I noticed the definition of the auto popover list in the spec isn't quite correct: https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#auto-popover-list \r\n\r\n> For each Element element in document's top layer: if element's popover attribute is in the auto state, then append element to popovers.\r\n\r\nshould become:\r\n\r\n> For each Element element in document's top layer: if element's popover attribute is in the auto state and element's popover visibility state is showing, then append element to popovers.\r\n\r\nThis basically removes auto popovers that were put in the top layer for different reasons (e.g. an auto popover that was full screened, or a `<dialog popover>` for which `showModal()` was called.\r\n\r\ncc @annevk @mfreed7 @josepharhar ",
